{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"旅發局：「幻彩詠香江」下周三告別　最後一晚加入煙火效果\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WINTER-FEST-261110-1530.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】旅發局表示，「幻彩詠香江」將於下周三晚正式向市民和旅客告別，當晚演出將會加入煙火效果。</p><p>旅發局主席林建岳：「陪伴香港22年的『幻彩詠香江』 ，亦會上演最後一場，特別加入煙火元素紀念這個別具意義的時刻。至於其他的光影項目，我們將於明年陸續推出。」</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.056897+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:37:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T02:03:52.585393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:01.664581+00:00","content_hash":"0a62a7155119eeacb521fa75b1ceef69b42e4bda507b9871c1064bce422f1cc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.056897+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}